{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COMBOLITE combines roguelike deckbuilders and autobattlers in a unique way.</strong><br><strong>Your goal is to hit the rock as hard as possible by making the perfect sequence of weapons.</strong> <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/fight.gif?t=1745434823\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is a combo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combos are defined by a sequence of 3 directions and a reward for pulling them off.</strong>  <br>Each weapon attacks in one of 8 directions, and you can execute a combo by placing them in your deck in the correct order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combos level up based on the amount of damage the 3 weapons performing the combo do.</strong> <br>The higher their level, the stronger and more useful they become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/combo.gif?t=1745434823\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLOIT the buffs you get!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combos make a certain category of weapons stronger, or provide an overall buff to the player, like increased shop luck.</strong>\u00a0The best strategy is to go with the flow. <strong>Try to play to the strengths of your buffs as much as possible. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can get these after <strong>every third fight</strong>, buying <strong>loot bags</strong> in the shop, opening <strong>treasure chests</strong> and <strong>completing objectives</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/buffs.gif?t=1745434823\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BREAK THE GAME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I've seen millions of damage done, someone hit <strong>13 BILLION damage</strong> in a single turn! You're encouraged to <strong>break this game,</strong> and with <strong>multiplicative buffs</strong> this isn't hard to do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you have to be quick! <strong>The target damage</strong> keeps increasing every turn. If you can't deal enough damage, well... you can guess what happens I suppose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/damage.gif?t=1745434823\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features: (still W.I.P.)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 categories of weapons, with a total of 30 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">26 collectable buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">448 combos with 4 different special rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 difficulty settings to make your runs even more interesting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/extras/terrain.gif?t=1745434823\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499540?t=1745434823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745434823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/f7fc4d35e381de89208eebcea3e6053ba6d1be5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745434823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499540/f7fc4d35e381de89208eebcea3e6053ba6d1be5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745434823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"